docs/proposals/IDEAS.md:28:| 2 | **Policy declaration mechanism.** Legacy `Concrete.toml [policy]`, `POLICY_FILES.md`; capability budgets (R-0184, R-0186) | PLANNED **in phase F** (R-0201). The format, scope and composition across dependencies are undecided. | **Owner decision before B1:** one policy file, with scoping and composition, over the same facts. Predictable, termination and capability budgets all use it. |
docs/proposals/IDEAS.md:31:| 5 | **Frames and dependency-flow facts** (reads/writes/modifies, `depends`; `legacy/docs/verification/SPARK_CLASS_ASSURANCE.md`) | PLANNED: R-0524 frames (E); R-0239 → R-0473; package summaries R-0380 → R-0383 (G). Missing from v1 of this list. | Keep. Add "what memory it writes" and "what its outputs depend on" to the facts-query schema now, as "not established" until E. |
docs/proposals/IDEAS.md:33:| 7 | **Exact source locations on every fact and obligation** (`examples/source_maps`; spec O4) | At risk: Core spans are absent and O4 is open | **Spec/compiler:** carry spans from slice 0 into CheckedCore and the facts schema. |
docs/proposals/IDEAS.md:35:| 9 | **I/O driver for the Lean reference evaluator** (`VERIFIED_PIPELINE.md`) | Implicit in R-0491/R-0496; no explicit task | **Roadmap:** name it inside R-0491 by B1. Independent expected outcomes for I/O programs need it. |
docs/proposals/IDEAS.md:61:- **Deterministic compiler output:** reproducible builds at B1 (decided 2026-11-06).
