| 4 | `while`, `for i from a until b` (OD47–OD49), labels, `break`, `continue`, `#[invariant]`, `#[variant]`, `#[may_not_terminate("reason")]` on loops; the loop rule; termination facts; the step-counting cost model for loops | C |
| 5 | functions, parameters, calls, recursion with one function `#[variant]` or permission per recursive component (OD82), `#[requires]`, `#[ensures]`, literal expected types (OD31, OD138); closed call evidence; stack and depth facts from final artifacts; proven stack bounds for recursion; the step-counting cost model extended through calls | C |
