docs/proposals/SPEC_UNIFICATION.md:78:proof checks after every commit.
docs/proposals/SPEC_UNIFICATION.md:81:foundation>?"; [decision](../decisions.md#decided-2026-11-07-foundation-first)). A2i writes the
docs/proposals/SPEC_UNIFICATION.md:90:questions are decided (sections 4 and 5.1).
docs/proposals/SPEC_UNIFICATION.md:129:collisions (`dec:729`). Rule 13 requires that `#[proof]` resolve to a typed theorem identity
